<span class="badge badge-confirmed">Confirmed</span>

<h2>Reservation Confirmed!</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Great news! Your parking reservation has been successfully confirmed. Your parking space is secured and ready for your arrival.</p>

<table class="details-table">
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Reference</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingReference}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Parking Facility</td>
    <td class="value">{{facilityName}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Date</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Reserved Start Time</td>
    <td class="value">{{startTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Reserved End Time</td>
    <td class="value">{{endTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if message}}
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Arrival Instructions</td>
    <td class="value">{{message}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>

<div class="alert-box alert-info">
  <strong>Arrival Tips:</strong> Please have your booking reference (<strong>{{bookingReference}}</strong>) ready upon entering the parking facility. Automated license plate scanners or barcode kiosks will grant you entry during your reserved window.
</div>

<p>We look forward to serving you!</p>
